**Approval Decision:** APPROVED
**Approver:** @{outputs('Wait_For_Approval')?['body/responder']}
**Approval Date:** @{utcNow()}

**Remediation Result:** ✅ SUCCESS
- Replaced @{length(body('Parse_Current_Principals'))} principals with @{length(outputs('Query_Approved_Groups_For_Zone')?['body/value'])} approved security groups
- Post-remediation validation: PASSED

**Compliance Status:** COMPLIANT
**Remediation Date:** @{utcNow()}

