**Agent:** @{outputs('Build_Approval_Card_Data')?['agent_name']}
**Environment:** @{outputs('Build_Approval_Card_Data')?['environment_name']}
**Zone:** @{outputs('Build_Approval_Card_Data')?['zone_name']}

**Approval Decision:** APPROVED
**Approver:** @{outputs('Wait_For_Approval')?['body/responder']}

**Remediation Result:** ⚠️ FAILED
**Error:** HTTP @{outputs('HTTP_PATCH_BAP_Permissions')?['statusCode']} - @{outputs('HTTP_PATCH_BAP_Permissions')?['body']}

**Next Steps:**
- Verify Managed Identity has Power Platform Administrator role
- Check agent and environment IDs are valid
- Retry remediation manually if needed

**Compliance Status:** ERROR

